# Sitecore SDK

- **Config:** env vars in `sitecore.config.ts`; never hardcode API keys
- **Client:** `getPage`, `getDictionary`, `getPreview`, `getErrorPage` via Sitecore client
- **Components:** register in component map; validate fields; use `<Text>`, `<RichText>`, `<Image>`
- **Placeholders:** strongly-typed names; fallback for missing content

Full detail: [`.agents/docs/RULES-sitecore.md`](../../.agents/docs/RULES-sitecore.md)
